    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Business Consultant is a professional WordPress theme designed for consultants, agencies, startups, and corporate businesses. It includes a modern homepage with multiple sections for services, case studies, team members, testimonials, and contact information. The responsive layout works perfectly on all devices and screen sizes. Businesses can easily present consulting services, company details, and business solutions in a clean and organized format. The theme supports banners, social media links, and call-to-action buttons to improve customer engagement. ST Business Consultant is lightweight, SEO friendly, and easy to customize without coding knowledge. It also works with popular WordPress plugins for added flexibility. The simple design and structured layout help businesses build trust and create a strong online presence."
    },
